operation = "cache"
fixity = "tending"

^"stream"{
 >>[2026-10-12 10:59] verify — Logic and linear algebra carry the Parallel and Competing Theories frame; programs, data structures, probability, optimization and forecasting do not. topic-wiring.test.mjs still guards the hubs.
 >>[2026-10-27 10:29] decide — The root lists grandchildren beside the area hubs, and the same rasters wear new alts on the spokes. math-signal-field-square.webp is a wash. papergami-kinetic.webp is one still. The clockwork plate is labeled as a scheduler and the crystal plate as compression. The sunflower webp belongs on nutrition; symmetry also has the png. Figure homes and the depth rule are in index.spw. The next patch is the root shelf, not the programs frame.
}

^"open"{
 regional_lenses = ~"./index.spw#wonder_topic_building_blocks_regional_lenses"
